        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-08-10T21:36:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Either you wait (as &gt;G have said they will be doing an \"unlimited\" run of the promos after/when the last expansions ships) or you take a look on Boardgamegeek and find the printable files from there.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
